    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>While in a Maw Frenzy, the Stonewyrm gains the following abilities.</p><ul><li><p>Access to the Earthen Frenzy and Death Throes actions.</p></li><li><p>Earthen Spike strikes deal an additional 3d6 bleed damage.</p></li><li><p>Jaws strikes deal an additional 2d10 persistent poison damage.</p></li><li><p>The Stonewyrm becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened}. It can use this Quickened action only for Death Throes, Raise Cliffs, or Resilience of Mountains.</p></li><li><p>The Stonewyrm's Poisonous Exhalation recharges on a critical hit.</p></li><li><p>The Stonewyrm cannot be reduced below 1 hp.</p></li></ul>"
